# The functions HOSTLINK.EXE may import, as dll!Function: ANSI entry points that Windows 95 and ReactOS 0.4.16 both export (the ReactOS side checked against
# the export lists in docs/plans/host-integration.md). GetClipboardSequenceNumber is looked up with GetProcAddress, since Windows 95 has none.
